    "text": "By Sumit Jangir ,\n1 days ago NEW YORK (Diya TV) — Police arrested actors Susan Sarandon and Hannah Einbinder during a protest near United Nations headquarters Thursday as Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu prepared to address the General Assembly. New York City Council member Chi Ossé and Democratic congressional candidate Darializa Avila Chevalier were also... Read full article",
